OL,3,GNEWSASurvivalist dropped into Arctic
OL,4,ACircle alone with just 10 tools for TV
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FDropped in the Arctic Circle with just
OL,8,F10 tools and a camera, Andrew Price
OL,9,Ffaced loneliness and lit fires to cook
OL,10,Fand boil water.
OL,12,FDespite worries of grizzly bears and
OL,13,Fthe extreme cold, the 51-year-old has
OL,14,Fbecome the first Welshman to compete in
OL,15,Fthe US TV show Alone: World
OL,16,FChampionship.
OL,18,F"I've always wanted to push myself in a
OL,19,Freally cold environment, it doesn't get
OL,20,Fcolder than the Arctic Circle so it
OL,21,Ffelt like the perfect place to go,"
OL,22,FPrice said.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
